    "description": "Edit only the campaign block of scheduler_configs/loop/general_vr.json. Replace the `aos` arm — whose sole mechanism is recorded at zero activity (aos.tape_wins = 0), so it currently converts wall clock into nothing — with a grid arm `grid-steer-timer-crash` carrying overlay {\"steer_terms.crash_after_timer_sends\": 1.0}. feedback.steer is already true at session scope; do not re-set it. No other steer term is unzeroed, no other arm is touched, arm count stays 5 per overlay-swap-not-arm-add-protocol. Readout is the already-merged steerAuthority serialization (steer-authority-counter-rewire, steer-preference-denominator-counter, steer-stats-export-parity-test), which is confirmed present in every eval record. Pre-registered fire criterion: preferenceExpressed > 0 on the new arm, and preferenceExpressed remains exactly 0 on the four untouched grid arms as a within-session control. Objective as usual, per-arm and union.",
