    "rationale": "The 2026-08-30 log established as a policy fact that steerAuthority.preferenceExpressed == 0 over 956M steps because every steer_terms weight in the graded config is literally zero — i.e. the entire feedback lens has been measured on a dead path for this epoch. This is the single cheapest change that makes the block non-vacuous, and the term chosen is the one the relaxation-gap reading names as load-bearing (crash while timer-descended sends are in flight), so a null here is informative about the mechanism rather than about the plumbing. It is strictly narrower than the parked parent (one term, one weight, one arm), which makes attribution possible when the parent's multi-term form would not.",
